            "block_content": "170. If a holiday as set forth in Article XII occurs during the employee's vacation period, he/she shall be granted an additional day of vacation at his/her regular pay, or an additional day's pay in the amount he/she would have received had he/she not been on vacation at the option of the Employer.",
